            <GameDBLocalizedString>         <LocID>HERO_EMPIRE_2_ALTERNATIVE</LocID>                                    <Text>Rao</Text>  </GameDBLocalizedString>
            <GameDBLocalizedString>         <LocID>HERO_EMPIRE_2_DESCRIPTION_ATLERNATIVE</LocID>                        <Text>For Arjun Rao, the discharge from the UNSS service was the fall. But the world will not stop spinning by the termination of a contract, and true loyalty is not measured by the tidiness of your uniform. So it's time to clench fists and dust off the old "Pirate" ways of the Sovereigns. Only the end justifies the means.  </Text>  </GameDBLocalizedString>

            <GameDBLocalizedString>         <LocID>HERO_MOLE_13_ALTERNATIVE</LocID>                                     <Text>Admiral Muff</Text>  </GameDBLocalizedString>
            <GameDBLocalizedString>         <LocID>HERO_MOLE_13_DESCRIPTION_ALTERNATIVE</LocID>                         <Text>Becoming a Fossorian Space Navy Admiral usually requires an excessive talent for leading ... and the backstabbing. The fact that Muff is certainly not your usual "backstabbing" Fossorian once brought him a cult following and a second place in the race for the Supreme Leader chair. Of course, there are no second places in a contest like this.    </Text>  </GameDBLocalizedString>
            
