            <GameDBLocalizedString>         <LocID>PLANET_EA_03_ID</LocID>                                              <Text>UNSC 4298g Chimera</Text>  </GameDBLocalizedString>
            <GameDBLocalizedString>         <LocID>PLANET_EA_03_DESCRIPTION</LocID>                                     <Text><![CDATA[Its gaping wound, a reminder of the Holy War, offers the observer a peek into the true nature of Primal planets. They have been altered from the core to the surface. Only the thin layer of biosphere feels somewhat genuine.\n\n As the gargantuan gravitor in the Planet's heart takes its last breaths, its rotation returns to a slower, more natural cycle. Within a few years, the planet will begin to drift further into the cold void of space. \n\n Many have searched for the secrets of this pre-apocalyptic world, but found only the end of all roads.]]></Text>  </GameDBLocalizedString>
            
